# {{.ProjectName}}

A [Wails v3](https://v3.wails.io) desktop app built with [HTMX](https://htmx.org) and [Templ](https://templ.guide).

## Stack

- Wails v3 (alpha) — desktop runtime
- Templ — Go-native HTML templating
- HTMX 4.x — fragment swaps without a JS framework
- Tailwind CSS 4.x (CSS-first config via @import "tailwindcss" + @source directives) — styling
- Stdlib `net/http.ServeMux` — routing
- Taskfile — task runner

## Requirements

- Go 1.26+
- [Wails v3 CLI](https://v3.wails.io/getting-started/installation)
- [Task](https://taskfile.dev) — `go install github.com/go-task/task/v3/cmd/task@latest`
- [Templ CLI](https://templ.guide/quick-start/installation) — `go install github.com/a-h/templ/cmd/templ@latest`
- Node.js 20+ (for Tailwind)

## Getting started

```bash
task install     # go mod download + npm install
task dev         # parallel: templ --watch, tailwind --watch, wails3 dev
```

Edit `web/pages/home.templ`, save, watch the window refresh.

